  "claim_boundary": [
    "One bounded mechanistic exploratory Sequence-303 ABC task-calibration experiment, not a literal reproduction of the 14-task paper.",
    "Uses 16 gold-labelled source TRAIN examples per task on the target; not target-free transfer.",
    "Learned versus initial core and vectors with identical fresh target alignment and identical supervision isolates incremental source sequence knowledge from learning on target examples.",
    "The initial core is the published core and initial ABC vectors copied from rte; it is not a random core.",
    "Qwen3-4B is a published PorTAL base seen by the original core. This tests reuse of Qwen3-8B sequence learning on 4B, not unseen-base generalization of the original core.",
    "Original validation/test and all original fresh288 inputs were previously exposed; all outcomes are descriptive exploratory evidence, not new confirmation.",
    "Persistent rank8 q/v alpha16 LoRA uses the same batches, AdamW updates, EMA objective and final checkpoint rule. It is not the paper per-task rank16 full-module baseline.",
    "No grid, heldout selection, model downloads, GPU/provider/queue provisioning, NFS copies or publication. Parent owns staging and execution."
  ],
